@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to Novel Logger</h1>
    <p>Are you an avid reader? Do you wish you had an easier way to record your latest up to date novels or unforgettable chapters? Not to worry, Novel Logger is what you want.</p>
    <p>Novel Logger is a feature packed web application designed to streamline the tedious work of recording your latest reads! It offers features such as tracking your latest read chapters, saving nostalgic chapters, and adding notes so you don't have to try and remember what happened up until that chapter.</p>
    <p><a asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Register">Register</a> now so you can just relax and read!</p>
</div>
